WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.240
I'm Sathian, founder of Tooth Fairy Network

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.740
and a father of two.

00:00:05.140 --> 00:00:08.200
I built this for my own children, and I'm
making

00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:10.900
it available to the rest of the world, for
anyone

00:00:10.860 --> 00:00:12.660
who wants to learn along with us.

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:14.520
Welcome to Learn with Tanda.

00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:17.360
Together, we'll explore how the technology
works

00:00:17.320 --> 00:00:20.320
through simple stories, questions, and
drawing

00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:20.900
activities.

00:00:21.260 --> 00:00:23.980
Pick a lesson with your child, and let's
discover

00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:24.880
something together.
